  5. Render the output: draw 0-frames; at each source corner paint the pattern (rotated to its kind) in that source's color; at every non-source corner paint the pattern (rotated to its kind) in that corner's output color.
  6. Derive input from output: for every non-source corner, erase all painted cells of its pattern back to bg/0 except keep only the marker pixel at rotated (k_max,k_max) in that corner's color. Source corners retain their full pattern.
